---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Resource Guide — Base Impact" description="How to use the Base Impact resource directory to find food, shelter, health, housing, and recovery services in Brevard County, FL.">
  <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-body mb-4 fade-in">Resource Guide</h1>
  <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-6 text-muted leading-relaxed fade-in">
    <p>The Base Impact directory is a simpler, local starting point that works alongside 211. It lists food, shelter, showers, health, housing, and recovery resources in Brevard County.</p>
    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-body mt-6">How to use the directory</h2>
    <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-2">
      <li><strong>Browse by category</strong> — Filter resources by type: food, shelter, health, housing, recovery, and more.</li>
      <li><strong>Search by name</strong> — Type a keyword to find specific organizations or services.</li>
      <li><strong>Check hours</strong> — Each listing shows open/closed status based on current time.</li>
      <li><strong>Get directions</strong> — Tap "Map" for Google Maps navigation, "Bus" for the Space Coast Area Transit (SCAT) trip planner, or "Walk" for walking directions.</li>
      <li><strong>Call directly</strong> — Tap the phone number to call the organization.</li>
    </ol>
    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-body mt-6">Tips for finding help</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
      <li>Call 211 for 24/7 local help with any need.</li>
      <li>Use the "Need help now" button for urgent situations.</li>
      <li>Filter by "Open now" to see only currently available services.</li>
      <li>Save resources you might need later using the "Save" button.</li>
    </ul>
    <a href="/directory" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-lg bg-fill px-5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-on-fill hover:bg-fill-hover">Browse directory</a>
  </div>
</Base>
